    "lyrics": {
      "text": "O_ Thou Who for our sakes wast born of a Vir-gin, and didst suf-fer cru-ci-fix-ion, O Good One, and didst de-spoil__ death by death, and as God, didst re-veal the Res-ur-rec-tion: Dis-dain them not which Thou hast fash-ioned with Thy__ hand; show us Thy love for man-kind, O Mer-ci-ful One; ac-cept the The-o-to-kos that gave Thee birth, who in-ter-ced--eth for us; and do Thou, our Sav-iour, save__ a de-spair-ing peo--ple.____"
    }
  }
